      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling trapped by external expectations and struggling to find your own path. The pressure you're experiencing is immense and can make it difficult to see a way forward when everything around you feels confining. Remember that seeking out experiences, even in small ways, where you feel more like yourself can be a step towards finding the freedom you desire. Have you considered exploring interests or hobbies that are meaningful to you, outside of your expectations? This could be a way to slowly reclaim some agency over your life.",
